Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:55.85,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,54)\fad(200,0)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs34\c&H001C5CFF}Yonas Beshawred (StarSling)
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:55.85,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“CI is free for open source.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:55.85,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}Paying anyway means real
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:55.85,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}pain.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so for us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:03.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,we actually started off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:04.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a very different
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:07.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,product that was similar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,to another open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:08.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,project called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,So top of the year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,we started with a new
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:15.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,product and we saw the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,first signs of product
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,market fit when we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,shipped it to our first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,customer who is an open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:20.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,source project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:22.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's called Better Auth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.47,0:00:24.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is now part of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Vercel, and he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:27.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,like the maintainer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:29.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,the founder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:29.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,was like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:30.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,"This is awesome." And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,he merged in the PR to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,migrate the runners
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:36.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,over, and that was the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:37.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,moment because it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:38.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,free, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you're an open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:39.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,project, you get CI for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:41.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,free. but if you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,willing to pay that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.32,0:00:43.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,means it's a pain point
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:45.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it's slow enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you're willing to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:47.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,pay money for it so that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,was the moment and then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,yeah that helped us get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:51.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,visibility because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:52.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,everyone could see that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.56,0:00:53.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,they were using our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:54.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,runners and so that was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:55.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,the beginning of it
